        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Southern Africa, Zambezi River, Zambia\n- People: Cecil Rhodes\n- Topics: British protectorates, country division\n\nFacts:\n- Cecil Rhodes founded the former British protectorate in the southern Africa territory.\n- The former British protectorate in southern Africa later became two countries.\n- The Zambezi River became the border between the two countries.\n- Zambia lies north of the Zambezi River.\n- The chunk states that Chile lies south of the Zambezi River.",
